; A negative rent gives a negative penalty, -150.00 * 2 = -300: it violates
; the rule that a penalty is not negative, and is reported as such rather
; than as 0. The obligation is still pending: the trace ends before its
; deadline. The rent is not positive at activation, so the invariant is false.
(scenario payment_negative
  (spec "examples/core/core_payment.triel")
  (entry "2026-02-25T00:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data (rent (dec -150.00)) (notice_given (bool false))))
  (entry "2026-03-01T00:00:00Z" (act landlord (enter (name tenant)) must_not)
    (data (rent (dec -150.00)) (notice_given (bool false)))))
